          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "▪︎PEP — not previously vaccinated: RIG 20 IU/kg around the wound site as much as possible, remainder IM at an anatomically distant site + vaccine 1 mL IM (deltoid) days 0, 3, 7, 14 (immunocompromised: days 0, 3, 7, 14, 28)"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
